{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10220","headline":"伤歙州陈二使君 · 李嘉佑","name":"伤歙州陈二使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君辞满卧沧洲，一旦云亡万事休。\n慈母断肠妻独泣，寒云惨色水空流。\n江村故老长怀惠，山路孤猨亦共愁。\n寂寞荒坟近渔浦，野松孤月即千秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}